### Test declansare criza financiara
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/market/events/trigger
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event_type": "BEAR_CRASH",
  "scope": "MARKET",
  "magnitude": 2.5,
  "duration_ticks": 2
}

### Get recent and active market events
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/market/events
Accept: application/json